    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "### Example Calculation\n\nFor a rectangular 600 x 600 mm unlined duct with an attenuation rate of 0.35 dB/m at 250 Hz frequency, the total sound attenuation over a 10 m duct length is:\n\n**(10 m) × (0.35 dB/m) = 3.5 dB**"
